STM32MP257F-DK direct-boot kernel changes (no OP-TEE, no U-Boot).

Consolidates: cpuidle-psci pm-domain keep, clk-stm32mp25 gpio/ipcc2 export,
mfd stm32-pwr wakeup pins, dts build restriction, and the LVDS display fix
(PHY PLL VCO-range constraint + panel rate default + modeset PLL lock +
non-fatal probe-time timeout, needed because no bootloader pre-locks the PLL).

